Package: gpcseq
Type: Package
Title: Group Sequential Analysis of Pairwise Treatment Effects
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("Lu", "Mao", email = "lmao@biostat.wisc.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8626-9822"))
Description: Estimate and monitor pairwise treatment effects when clinical
    histories continue to accrue between interim analyses. Implements
    survival-prioritized shared-window comparisons, censoring-weighted
    restricted win-loss statistics, and restricted net win time estimated
    from multistate occupation probabilities. Subject-level influences give
    cross-look covariance and stopping boundaries for calendar-time spending.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/lmaowisc/gpcseq
